abstract: "A native open-source iPhone and iPad application for acquiring LiDAR-derived coloured point clouds and exporting them as binary or ASCII PLY and XYZ files with accompanying metadata. Developed in the framework of the RIM Project (IP-2025-02-1060, HRZZ / IARH)."
